<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>Privacy Policy — FileVora</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Read the FileVora Privacy Policy to learn how we handle files, usage information, cookies and third-party services."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tool-unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/filevora-header-tools.css">

  <style>
    .legal-content {
      margin-top: 32px;
      color: #334155;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      margin: 32px 0 10px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 23px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      margin: 0 0 15px;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      margin: 10px 0 18px;
      padding-left: 24px;
    }

    .legal-content li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-content a {
      color: #009a73;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .legal-date {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include("partials/tool-header") %>

  <main class="info-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">FILEVORA</div>

        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="info-lead">
          This Privacy Policy explains how FileVora handles information when
          you use our website and online tools.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-date">
          Last updated: September 20, 2026
        </p>

        <div class="legal-content">
          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

          <p>
            You can use most FileVora tools without creating an account or
            directly providing personal information.
          </p>

          <p>
            When you access FileVora, our hosting and analytics providers may
            automatically receive limited technical information, such as:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Browser and device type</li>
            <li>Operating system</li>
            <li>Approximate location based on IP address</li>
            <li>Pages visited and tool usage</li>
            <li>Date, time and referring website</li>
            <li>Diagnostic, security and error information</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>2. Files and Content Processed by Tools</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora is designed to process many files and text inputs directly
            in your browser. When a tool processes information locally, the file
            remains on your device and is not intentionally uploaded to
            FileVora’s servers.
          </p>

          <p>
            Tool behaviour may differ depending on the feature, browser,
            libraries used and future service updates. You should not use
            FileVora to process confidential, highly sensitive or irreplaceable
            information unless you have reviewed the relevant tool and are
            comfortable with how it operates.
          </p>

          <p>
            Always retain a backup of important original files before using any
            online file-processing tool.
          </p>

          <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>

          <p>Technical and usage information may be used to:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Provide and maintain FileVora</li>
            <li>Improve our tools, design and performance</li>
            <li>Detect errors, abuse and security threats</li>
            <li>Understand general website usage</li>
            <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>4. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora and third-party services may use cookies, local storage or
            similar technologies to operate the website, remember preferences,
            measure performance and support advertising.
          </p>

          <p>
            You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings.
            Blocking certain cookies may affect the operation of some website
            features.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Advertising</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora may display advertisements provided by third-party
            advertising partners, including Google or other advertising
            networks. These providers may use cookies or similar technologies
            to show, measure and personalize advertisements in accordance with
            their own privacy policies.
          </p>

          <p>
            Where required by applicable law, users may be given options to
            manage consent for advertising cookies and personalized
            advertising.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora may rely on third-party services for hosting, analytics,
            advertising, content delivery, security and website functionality.
            These services may process limited technical information according
            to their own terms and privacy policies.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our website may also contain links to external websites. FileVora
            does not control and is not responsible for the content, security
            or privacy practices of third-party websites.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora does not intentionally retain files that are processed
            locally in your browser. Technical logs and analytics information
            handled by hosting or third-party providers may be retained for the
            periods necessary to provide, secure and improve their services.
          </p>

          <h2>8. Data Security</h2>

          <p>
            We use reasonable measures intended to protect the website and
            reduce unauthorized access. However, no internet service or method
            of electronic storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
          </p>

          <p>
            For additional information, please read our
            <a href="/security">Security page</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>9. Children’s Privacy</h2>

          <p>
            FileVora is not directed to children under the age required to
            independently consent to online services in their country. We do
            not knowingly collect personal information from children.
          </p>

          <h2>10. Your Privacy Choices</h2>

          <p>
            Depending on your location, you may have rights relating to your
            personal information, including rights to access, correct or
            request deletion of certain information.
          </p>

          <p>
            You may also manage cookies and tracking preferences using your
            browser settings or any consent controls displayed on the website.
          </p>

          <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy when FileVora, our tools or legal
            requirements change. The updated version will be published on this
            page with a revised “Last updated” date.
          </p>

          <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>

          <p>
            If you have questions or requests concerning this Privacy Policy,
            please contact us through our
            <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a class="hero-button" href="/#tools">Explore tools →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">F</span>
          <span class="brand-name">File<span>Vora</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>Fast, simple online tools for everyday file tasks.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Company</h3>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <a href="/contact">Email</a>
        <a href="/contact">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/contact">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © <span data-current-year></span> FileVora. All rights reserved.
      </span>

      <span>All in One Tool.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-current-year]")
      .forEach(function (element) {
        element.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
      });
  </script>

  <script src="/js/filevora-tools.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/filevora-header-tools.js"></script>

</body>
</html>